sequenceDiagram
    participant browser
    participant server
    
    browser->>server: GET https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/spa
    server-->>browser: serves the page that contains the notes box and a send button

    browser->>server: GET https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/main.css
    server-->>browser: serves the css file

    browser->>server: GET https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/spa.js
    server-->>browser: serves the js code for main

    browser->>server: https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/data.json
    server-->>browser: serves the data that's in the page
